/target
ci/.cache/
# The release build keeps its own cargo cache and target directory, so it never
# fights the Flatpak build for target/flatpak nor the CI image for ci/.cache.
ci/.cache-release/
# The distributable binary itself. Built by `just release`, published from a
# release job — never committed, because a checked-in binary is one nobody can
# tell was built from the checkout beside it.
ci/release/
